To {!advpm__Matter__c.advpm__Primary_Contact__c},

Your agreement for the purchase and sale of future receivables with {!advpm__Matter__c.Originating_Lender__c} has recently charged off. The amount due on the loan is {!advpm__Matter__c.Total_Amount_Charged_Off__c}. We understand that there could be many reasons why you were unable to perform and therefore wanted to reach out to see if you were interested in working out some sort of settlement without having to go the litigation route.

Please feel free to call and/or email us to discuss further.

Sincerely,

{!advpm__Matter__c.Lead_Attorney__c} | {!advpm__Matter__c.Lead_Attorney_Title__c}

{!advpm__Matter__c.Email_Signature_Company__c}
